1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:01,590
So,

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:06,730
I'm standing here in the
neighborhood that's called

3
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:10,250
the Four Religions Quarter.

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:14,400
When I say four religions, I actually mean

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,310
three different streams of
Christianity and Judaism.

6
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:23,200
In this beautiful neighborhood you can
find three different kinds of churches

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,450
that serve three Christian streams,

8
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,900
as well as a beautiful synagogue
called the White Stork.

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:35,800
We visited that synagogue
on the last Yom Kippur,

10
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:40,190
and it was really an exciting experience.

11
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:45,500
Moreover, this neighborhood is filled
with passages and little streets

12
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,300
filled with cafés and restaurants.

13
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,110
I'm standing now in one of
the famous passages called

14
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:57,100
Pokoyhof. In translation it
means the garden of Pokoy.

15
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:01,800
Just at the entrance to this passage
there is a very nice café called Pokoy.

16
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:06,700
When you enter the passage,
first of all you can be impressed

17
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:11,190
by this building, this kind of
courtyard that I'm standing in,

18
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:16,550
with beautiful architecture
and colorful tiles.

19
00:01:16,550 --> 00:01:19,400
Inside this passage you can find Starbucks.

20
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:24,700
You can also find Charlotte's café,
which is a French coffee house.

21
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:30,790
You can find some bars and other restaurants.

22
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:36,290
Just adjacent to here, there's a very
famous little street called Antoniego,

23
00:01:36,290 --> 00:01:40,300
that is also filled with
restaurants and cafés.

24
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:46,270
I recommend coming here and strolling in
those beautiful passages and little streets.

25
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:50,950
Another passage that is very
interesting is the passage of neons.

26
00:01:51,490 --> 00:01:56,600
I recommend coming to this
passage in the evening,

27
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,790
when all the neons are shining
bright in beautiful colors.

28
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:01,770
See you in our next video.

29
00:02:02,630 --> 00:02:03,800
Do widzenia!
